{"seq":3,"slug":"competitive-integrity","title":"竞技完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/balance/competitive-integrity","wordCount":2030,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"竞技完整性\">竞技完整性</h1><p>一套合法、官方、人人可用的瞄准辅助，凭什么会威胁竞技完整性？因为它留了一道门。<a href=\"../techniques/magnetism-friction\">磁吸与减速区</a> 讲过，现代旋转磁吸加了「右摇杆必须正在朝目标移动」的门控 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>——本意是让辅助感觉像「帮你转」而非「替你转」。但这道门控是可以被刻意反复触发的：只要让摇杆不停地小幅抖动，就能持续满足「正在移动」的条件，把磁吸一次次拉满。这个操作叫 jitter aim，是一个不装外挂、不改内存、纯靠官方机制本身就能把辅助推到接近自瞄的漏洞。竞技完整性这一篇讨论的，就是这条「合法辅助」与「事实自瞄」之间越来越模糊的红线，以及厂商怎么划、怎么守。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>竞技完整性（competitive integrity）指一套官方、人人可用的机制，因留下可被刻意利用的口子而威胁到竞技公平。它的核心案例是 <strong>jitter aim</strong>：旋转磁吸的门控 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g=\\max(0,\\hat{s}\\cdot\\hat{t}_{scr})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1285em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 本意是要求「摇杆正在朝目标移动」，但玩家高频来回微抖右摇杆即可让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 常驻高位，把磁吸近乎不间断地拉满——用完全合法的输入逼近自动瞄准。判定它是否越线，靠的是两个概念：<strong>能力来源</strong>（多少来自实时人工操作、多少来自自动化）与<strong>红线光谱</strong>（从减速区、正常磁吸、手动 jitter、脚本抖杆到完全自瞄的连续谱）。手动 jitter 处在最难判的中段：它需要真实技巧，却利用的是机制缺陷而非设计意图，因此正解是<strong>从机制侧封堵</strong>（收紧门控）而非封禁玩家。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>判定 / 处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>jitter aim</td>\n<td>抖杆维持门控、磁吸常驻满档</td>\n<td>灰区，趋向禁止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力来源</td>\n<td>实时操作 vs 自动化的占比</td>\n<td>划红线的依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机制侧封堵</td>\n<td>收紧门控而非处罚玩家</td>\n<td>与手感权衡的战场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"jitter-aim-门控被反向利用\">jitter aim：门控被反向利用</h2><p>先把机理说透。门控 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g = \\max(0, \\hat{s}\\cdot\\hat{t}_{scr})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1285em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 奖励「摇杆推动方向与准星指向目标一致」。设计者假设玩家是在自然追踪时顺带满足它。但玩家发现：如果高频地来回微抖右摇杆，每一次抖动的分量里总有朝向目标的成分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 便被持续维持在高位，旋转磁吸几乎不间断地满档输出。效果是准星像被磁铁死死咬住横移的敌人，追踪能力远超正常推杆——一种用合法输入触发的、接近自动瞄准的追踪。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>正常追踪： </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo>≈</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> 时高时低</mtext><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>jitter： </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> 近乎常驻</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{正常追踪：}\\ g \\approx \\hat{s}\\cdot\\hat{t}_{scr}\\ \\text{时高时低}\\qquad \\text{jitter：}\\ g \\approx g_{max}\\ \\text{近乎常驻}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">正常追踪：</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.073em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时高时低</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jitter</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">近乎常驻</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它之所以棘手，是因为从任何客户端完整性的角度看，jitter 玩家没有作弊：没有第三方软件、没有内存篡改、输入全部来自真实摇杆。<a href=\"../../game-development/game-anti-cheat-security/foundations/cheat-taxonomy\">反作弊系统</a> 擅长抓的是「非法输入注入」「客户端被篡改」，而 jitter 是「合法输入 + 官方机制」的组合，落在传统作弊分类学的盲区里。这也让它成为竞技完整性最纯粹的案例：问题不在玩家违规，而在机制本身留了口子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"红线画在哪-一个光谱而非一条线\">红线画在哪：一个光谱而非一条线</h2><p>「合法辅助」到「作弊自瞄」之间不是一刀两断，而是一个连续光谱。厂商必须在这个光谱上人为划一条线，线的位置本身就是价值判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>玩家剩余控制</th>\n<th>合法性判定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>减速区</td>\n<td>缩放已输入转速</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>公认合法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正常旋转磁吸</td>\n<td>追踪时注入部分转速</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>合法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>jitter aim</td>\n<td>反复抖杆维持满档磁吸</td>\n<td>中低（靠操作触发）</td>\n<td>灰区，趋向禁止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方辅助脚本</td>\n<td>硬件/软件自动抖杆</td>\n<td>低（自动化）</td>\n<td>明确作弊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全自瞄外挂</td>\n<td>内存读取 + 自动锁头</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>明确作弊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键的判定不在「效果有多强」，而在「这份能力有多少来自玩家的实时操作，多少来自自动化」。手动 jitter 处在最难判的中段：它需要玩家真实、持续、有技巧地抖杆，因而有人辩称这是「操作技巧」；但它利用的是机制缺陷而非设计意图，效果又逼近自瞄，所以多数厂商趋向从机制侧封堵。而一旦有人用宏、连发手柄或第三方软件把抖杆自动化，就毫无争议地越线成 <a href=\"../../game-development/game-anti-cheat-security/clientside/memory-integrity\">反作弊 · 客户端完整性</a> 要抓的对象。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[能力来源] --&gt; B{来自实时人工操作?}&#10;    B --&gt;|全部| C[减速/正常磁吸&lt;br/&gt;合法]&#10;    B --&gt;|靠抖杆技巧触发| D[手动 jitter&lt;br/&gt;灰区 机制侧封堵]&#10;    B --&gt;|宏/硬件自动化| E[脚本抖杆&lt;br/&gt;反作弊查处]&#10;    B --&gt;|外部程序接管| F[自瞄外挂&lt;br/&gt;封禁]&#10;    D --&gt; G[从机制改门控&lt;br/&gt;而非封玩家]&#10;    E --&gt; H[输入合法性检测]&#10;    F --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[能力来源] --&gt; B{来自实时人工操作?}\n    B --&gt;|全部| C[减速/正常磁吸&lt;br/&gt;合法]\n    B --&gt;|靠抖杆技巧触发| D[手动 jitter&lt;br/&gt;灰区 机制侧封堵]\n    B --&gt;|宏/硬件自动化| E[脚本抖杆&lt;br/&gt;反作弊查处]\n    B --&gt;|外部程序接管| F[自瞄外挂&lt;br/&gt;封禁]\n    D --&gt; G[从机制改门控&lt;br/&gt;而非封玩家]\n    E --&gt; H[输入合法性检测]\n    F --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"从机制侧封堵-black-ops-7-的做法\">从机制侧封堵：Black Ops 7 的做法</h2><p>对付 jitter 这类「合法输入触发的机制漏洞」，罚玩家既不公平也抓不准（谁能证明一次抖杆是作弊而非手抖？），正确的战场在机制本身。Call of Duty: Black Ops 7 在 2026 年上市前后对旋转辅助做了针对性调整，思路正是收紧门控的可利用性：其一，拉长「达到满档旋转辅助之前的距离/时间窗口」，让抖杆没法瞬间把磁吸拉满；其二，新增更严格的右摇杆瞄准要求——右摇杆若没在有效地追踪目标，旋转辅助只给一个大幅削弱的档位。上市时这个最小档位相比 Beta 削了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span></span></span></span></span>（后来从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span></span></span></span></span> 回调到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>，因为削太狠伤到了正常玩家的手感）。</p>\n<p>这组调整揭示了机制侧封堵的核心张力：<strong>收紧门控既削掉了 jitter 的收益，也削掉了正常玩家的辅助手感</strong>，二者共用同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\%\\to 25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span> 的回调正是这条钢丝的现场——封得太紧，普通玩家先受伤；封得太松，jitter 又活过来。这与 <a href=\"../foundations/perceptibility\">可察觉性与手感</a> 里「黄金区间因人而异」是同构的难题，只是这次一端站着想公平竞技的大多数，另一端站着钻机制空子的少数，而调的还是同一个旋钮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"竞技场景的额外约束\">竞技场景的额外约束</h2><p>在职业与排位场景，厂商往往叠加机制外的规则来兜底。一是<strong>输入透明</strong>：要求或鼓励公开使用的输入设备，让「手柄享辅助」这件事至少是可见的。二是<strong>外设合规</strong>：明令禁止把抖杆自动化的宏、连发、第三方转接器——这类一旦检出即按作弊处理，交给 <a href=\"../../game-development/game-anti-cheat-security/practice/matchmaking-bans\">反作弊 · 匹配与封禁</a>。三是<strong>赛事级参数</strong>：部分赛事会为职业组另设一套更保守的辅助参数，用降低整体辅助强度来压缩 jitter 的可利用空间，代价是所有手柄职业选手的手感一起变。竞技完整性最终不是靠单一手段守住的，而是「机制封堵 + 反作弊查处 + 赛事规则」三层叠加，且每一层都在和「别误伤正常玩家」反复权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>jitter aim 反向利用了旋转磁吸的摇杆门控 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>：高频抖杆维持「正在朝目标移动」条件，把磁吸近乎常驻满档，用合法输入逼近自瞄。</li>\n<li>它落在传统作弊分类的盲区——无第三方软件、无内存篡改，问题在机制留了口子而非玩家违规。</li>\n<li>合法到作弊是一个光谱，红线画在「能力有多少来自实时人工操作、多少来自自动化」；手动 jitter 是最难判的中段。</li>\n<li>正确战场在机制侧：Black Ops 7 拉长满档窗口 + 加严右摇杆要求（最小档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\%\\to 25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span> 回调），但收紧门控会同时伤到正常手感——竞技完整性靠机制封堵、反作弊、赛事规则三层叠加守住。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>被利用的门控 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 的原始定义：<a href=\"../techniques/magnetism-friction\">磁吸与减速区</a></li>\n<li>可察觉性为何放大 jitter 的舆论反弹：<a href=\"../foundations/perceptibility\">可察觉性与手感</a></li>\n<li>合法/作弊分类的另一侧：<a href=\"../../game-development/game-anti-cheat-security/foundations/cheat-taxonomy\">反作弊 · 作弊分类学</a></li>\n<li>自动化抖杆的查处：<a href=\"../../game-development/game-anti-cheat-security/practice/matchmaking-bans\">反作弊 · 匹配与封禁</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"竞技完整性","id":"竞技完整性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"jitter aim：门控被反向利用","id":"jitter-aim-门控被反向利用"},{"level":2,"text":"红线画在哪：一个光谱而非一条线","id":"红线画在哪-一个光谱而非一条线"},{"level":2,"text":"从机制侧封堵：Black Ops 7 的做法","id":"从机制侧封堵-black-ops-7-的做法"},{"level":2,"text":"竞技场景的额外约束","id":"竞技场景的额外约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"跨平台平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/balance/crossplay-balance"},"next":{"title":"可达性瞄准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/practice/accessibility-aim"}}